Awww, cmon! It's enough to know that MasterMind rules are in effect!!
Try this: play a single note 5 times. If you get no response then try
another one until you do. Get to a point where you know of at least one
note that gives responses and one that doesn't. Playing with these two
notes yields the desired information. Now you can proceed to guess the
tune. Musical masterminds will choose a more optimal strategy but the
one presented here works (since there's no penalty for inefficiency).

